OL,3,GNEWSAMan killed and two arrested after
OL,4,Acar crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died and two women have been
OL,7,Farrested after a crash in Bradford,
OL,8,Faccording to police.
OL,10,FThe man died after he was hit by the
OL,11,Fcar on Killinghall Road at about 20:56
OL,12,FBST on Thursday.
OL,14,FTwo women, aged 19 and 47, were
OL,15,Farrested on suspicion of dangerous
OL,16,Fdriving and remain in custody.
OL,18,FPolice said inquiries were ongoing and
OL,19,Furged anyone with information or
OL,20,Fdashcam footage to get in contact.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
